CORE
instance_array3.sv
--bound 1
^\[main\.p1\] always .*: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.p2\] always .*: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.p3\] always .*: PROVED up to bound 1$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
An array of instances with named port connections. Connections that
match the port width are replicated; wider connections are split
bit-wise over the elements, per 1800-2017 23.3.3.
